    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE SHOP AND OFFICE EMPLOYEES (REGULATION OFEMPLOYMENT AND REMUNERATION) ACT (CHAPTER 129)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      270.89,
      401.9,
      295.67
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      311.09,
      401.88,
      349.19
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Shop and OfficeEmployees (Regulation of Employment and Remuneration)(Amendment) Act, No. of 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      364.73,
      401.87,
      402.83
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 18B of the Shop and Office Employees(Regulation of Employment and Remuneration) Act (Chapter129) is hereby amended, as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      418.25,
      401.88,
      456.47
    ],
    "text": "(1)by the repeal of subsection (2) of that section andthe substitution therefor of the followingsubsection:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      209.85,
      471.89,
      401.89,
      509.99
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(2) A female employee to whom this Partapplies, shall, if she is confined, be entitled totake leave for a period of:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      238.65,
      525.53,
      401.87,
      577.07
    ],
    "text": "(a)seventy days commencing on thedate of her confinement, if theconfinement results in the deliveryof live child ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      238.65,
      592.49,
      401.87,
      644.03
    ],
    "text": "(b)twenty eight days commencing onthe date of her confinement, if theconfinement does not result in thedelivery of a live child,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      209.85,
      659.45,
      381.58,
      670.79
    ],
    "text": "and the employer shall allow such leave.\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
